{&quot;messages&quot;:[{&quot;content&quot;:&quot;What animal lays the biggest egg?&quot;,&quot;role&quot;:&quot;user&quot;}],&quot;return_progress&quot;:true,&quot;sse_ping_interval&quot;:1,&quot;stream&quot;:true,&quot;tools&quot;:[{&quot;function&quot;:{&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Returns the current local date and time in ISO 8601 format, with the IANA time zone name&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;get_datetime&quot;,&quot;parameters&quot;:{&quot;properties&quot;:{},&quot;required&quot;:[],&quot;type&quot;:&quot;object&quot;}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;function&quot;},{&quot;function&quot;:{&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Get runtime info (OS name), may call when user asks about local files or shell commands&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;get_info&quot;,&quot;parameters&quot;:{&quot;properties&quot;:{},&quot;required&quot;:[],&quot;type&quot;:&quot;object&quot;}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;function&quot;}],&quot;reasoning_format&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;,&quot;reasoning_control&quot;:true,&quot;backend_sampling&quot;:false,&quot;timings_per_token&quot;:true}
```<p>Disabling tools removes the bit about mentioning instructions.<p>Just an interesting detail I noticed.<p>Do y&#x27;all have any penalty&#x2F;regularization w.r.t. reasoning traces or is it pure SFT -&gt; RL?
